      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-05T23:21:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about coding it up to work the way I describe (or even just using _ as a separator so it isn\u0027t really different configuration wise then what you got already), and then just creating a set of known good String combinations like: setof(\"HTTP_OAUTH\", \"HTTP_LDAP\") so that it can be easy in the future to enable other combos if someone is willing to test them out together?",
      "parentUuid": "9d58d249_d3b44c2b",
