      "writtenOn": "2024-11-06T22:16:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we may consider to use an existing framework to support stacked authentication e.g.\n- Apache Shiro (https://shiro.apache.org)\n- Keycloak (https://www.keycloak.org)\n- JAAS (https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/security/java-authentication-and-authorization-service-jaas-reference-guide.html)\n- Micronaut Security (https://guides.micronaut.io/latest/index.html#security)",
      "parentUuid": "d11c0094_799f2e55",
      "revId": "fe55c0b8fff3beb588182d67f48c24b4ec7eb0c8",
